WEBVTT

00:05:27.445 --> 00:05:31.088
In our film, we tell the story
of a young man

00:05:31.112 --> 00:05:36.310
who had to monitor livestreams
of self-mutilations and suicide attempts,

00:05:36.334 --> 00:05:38.009
again and again,

00:05:38.033 --> 00:05:41.099
and who eventually
committed suicide himself.

00:05:41.787 --> 00:05:44.527
It's not an isolated case,
as we've been told.

00:05:45.184 --> 00:05:49.164
This is the price all of us pay

00:05:49.188 --> 00:05:54.515
for our so-called clean
and safe and "healthy"

00:05:54.539 --> 00:05:56.823
environments on social media.

00:05:58.482 --> 00:06:01.077
Never before in the history of mankind